# Virtual Machine 

Once the virtual machine has been created a pair of keys must be created and placed within the .ssh file 

## Connectivity 

- Once key pairs have been moved to the .ssh file we need to move to the .ssh file from the home directory 
- I need to first cd into the home directory using cd /.ssh/
- then copy the ssh link provided by aws and paste it into git bash 
    * This will connect your git bash to the created virtual machine 